mages/episodes/195.jpg","content":"Joe Kay continues the freestyle of all music. \n\n<!--more-->\nLast week's show was definitely one of my favorites to date. It's weird how things work. It's the shows that I feel most unprepared for that end up doing well... maybe it's because I just really freestyle and go off of my whole library of music rather than trying to curate a specific vibe. It was hard to top last week's show but I did my best to really take it right back to the early beat era from 2008-2012 and played some current gems as well. I hope you enjoy this. I'll be back next week with a guest maybe.\n\nBless.\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10809,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-11-29T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"fJpth1GZ_gI","position":23,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"T.I. - Freak Though (feat. Pharrell) [Clean]","track":{"id":"pCp50y3l8GA","path":"/artists/t-i/tracks/freak-though-feat-pharrell-clean/","slug":"freak-though-feat-pharrell-clean","title":"Freak Though (feat. Pharrell) [Clean]","artist":{"slug":"ti","title":"T.I."},"artwork":"images/artists/t-i/tracks/freak-though-feat-pharrell-clean.png"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"bFTrJ22meoo","slug":"197","tags":[8,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-197"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #197","artwork":"/images/episodes/197.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10837,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-12-13T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay’s Set","position":0}},{"id":"eQP1uWNd2SU","position":55,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"T.I. - Why You Wanna (Instrumental)","track":{"id":"x71sNu4jPo0","path":"/artists/t-i/tracks/why-you-wanna-instrumental/","slug":"why-you-wanna-instrumental","title":"Why You Wanna (Instrumental)","artist":{"slug":"ti","title":"T.I."},"artwork":"imag